// Explicitly execute the installed TetherScript CLI instead of the embedded VM.
// Arguments are an argv list, never shell text. Capabilities remain explicit in
// that list; no full-access grant, credentials, or TLS bypass is added here.
// The outer tetherscript_plugin timeout must exceed timeout_ms (maximum 60s).
// Returns process_run's exit code, stdout, stderr, and timeout/truncation flags.
fn run_cli(arguments, timeout_ms) {
    return process_run("tetherscript", arguments, nil, timeout_ms)?
}